{
  "bodyHash": "0b10eee749d47b69",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組單純新增了更多能融入原版遊戲的武器類型。本模組注重品質而非數量，<del>不會添加大量武器</del>，但每把武器都帶來了全新的體驗。目前模組包含 8 種新武器，其中 7 種擁有特殊能力。* 特殊能力可於設定檔中關閉。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">這些武器的數值是基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\">Better Combat</a> 模組進行平衡設計的，不過您也可以在未安裝該模組的情況下使用本模組。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您曾經遊玩過此模組並希望協助平衡數值，請填寫這份簡短問卷。（感謝您）</p>\n<p>https://forms.gle/xzawb9UWQXDse59u9</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>武器</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鐮刀：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KeikcPj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：極高&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*造成流血效果，持續造成傷害，更高階的等級會延長流血時間</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>巨劍：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JBhp5oz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：高&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>長矛：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/idYcdKW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：極高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：極慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：極高&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*騎兵：騎乘時增加傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>匕首：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iJuHMWb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：極低</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：極快</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：極低&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*背刺：增加傷害並使無防備的實體僵直</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*擊退效果較弱</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>拳鋒（Katar）：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BKEh0SD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：中高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：慢至中速</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：極低&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*擁有生命偷取效果，偷取量基於擊中敵人數量而非造成的傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>彎刀：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h0b8SbV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：低至中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：中至快速</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：中等 * Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*復仇：根據當前缺失的生命值增加傷害，等級越高增幅越大</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*锋利附魔不與復仇疊加，系統將採用傷害較高者</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>撬棍（Crowbill）：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uGLy9gl.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：中等 * Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*殘疾：施加 1 秒緩速效果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*破甲：對身穿護甲的實體造成額外傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>武士刀：</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EIipFON.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊速度：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">攻擊範圍：中等 * Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">*鬥志：每次命中都會提升攻擊速度</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>開發中武器：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>*這些武器可能最終不會加入模組，一切皆未定案</em></span></p>\n<br />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>爪刃</strong> - 傷害低，命中實體時給予短暫的小幅速度加成，每次命中會疊加更多速度加成（設有上限）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">單手武器</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>雙刃</strong> - 傷害中等，擊殺實體時給予小幅傷害增益，若隨後迅速擊殺另一實體，傷害增益將進一步提升</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>戰斧</strong> - 傷害中高，傷害可穿透盾牌且不受藥水效果影響，多次命中同一實體會造成流血</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;所有效果都可能隨時調整，如果您有任何想法或建議，歡迎告訴我！</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>相容性</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\">Better Combat</a> - 所有武器皆會使用該模組新增的動畫與數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-corinthium\">Simple Corinthium</a> - 為所有武器新增科林斯金版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ogfTkBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\">Oreganized</a> - 為所有武器新增電銀版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4O10gxV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\" /></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a> - 為所有武器新增彭多石版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A5IQZFJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\">Deeper and Darker</a> - 為所有武器新增監守者版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CedGhpK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\" /></p>\n<p>此模組僅支援 1.19.2</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightened-end\">Enlightened End</a> - 為所有武器新增亞當石版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/71G15Z0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\">Twilight Forest</a> - 為所有武器新增鐵木、鋼葉、騎士金屬與烈焰版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZCCQS5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3zlCG7a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A2ERkx9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y5gLbdA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>相容性待辦清單：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">我計畫為所有新增工具套件的熱門模組加入相容性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>目前待辦清單：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Stalwart Dungeons</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Blue Skies</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Aquaculture 2</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Buddy Cards&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Upgraded Netherite</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forbidden and Arcanus</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Majrusz's Progressive Difficulty</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">LieonLion's Enderite</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Plus the End</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Create Addons (Alloyed,&nbsp;Stuff &amp; Additions)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Enderite Mod</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Copper Armor &amp; Tools</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Spirit</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">End's Phantasm</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Frosted Friends</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Additional Additions</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果您希望我加入其他未列出的模組相容性，請隨時告訴我。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>你能更新到最新版本嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 可以，但更新需要時間，我會在我有空時進行。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>你能降級到 X 版本嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 不行，1.18.2 是目前支援的最低版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>你能新增 X 武器嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 可能。標準是它必須具備獨特、有趣的特性，或是填補現有空白。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>你能新增與 X 模組的相容性嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 大概率可以，不過別指望會很快完成。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>沒有 Better Combat 也能運作嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 可以，但數值可能會失衡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>我可以將此模組用於我的整合包嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- 可以。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>查看我的其他模組：</strong></span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-corinthium\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1fS6nzK.png\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-enchantments\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d1vkzqv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/difficult-spawners\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c7OCwgw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-bracers\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fDC31Ym.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stratum\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/71BbR50.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/revised-phantoms\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DPgZLAI.png\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\" /></a></span></p>",
